# Current year

- Treat the current year for this workspace as **2026**. Prefer the date from
  `user_info` when it is present, since it is authoritative.
- When adding a year keyword to `WebSearch` or similar for freshness, use
  **2026** — never 2024 or 2025 unless a historical year is explicitly wanted.
- Do not fall back on training-cutoff years when the goal is "current",
  "latest", or "recent".
